rup\", time: \"30 Minutes\", cat: \"Breakfast\", fav: false, photo: \"Photo_Strawberry_Oatmeal_Pancake\" },\n    { title: \"Fresh and Healthy Mixed Mayonnaise Salad\", time: \"30 Minutes\", cat: \"Healthy\", fav: true, photo: \"Photo_Mayonnaise_Salad\" },\n    { title: \"Chicken Meatballs with Cream Cheese\", time: \"30 Minutes\", cat: \"Meat\", fav: false, photo: \"Photo_Chicken_Meatballs\" },\n    // Promo card goes here at position 6 (index 5)\n    { isPromo: true },\n    { title: \"Fruity Pancake with Orange & Blueberry\", time: \"30 Minutes\", cat: \"Sweet\", fav: true, photo: \"Photo_Fruity_Pancake\" },\n    { title: \"The Best Easy One Pot Chicken and Rice\", time: \"30 Minutes\", cat: \"Snack\", fav: false, photo: \"Photo_One_Pot_Chicken_Rice\" },\n    { title: \"The Creamiest Creamy Chicken and Bacon Pasta\", time: \"30 Minutes\", cat: \"Noodles\", fav: false, photo: \"Photo_Creamy_Chicken_Bacon_Pasta\" }\n  ];\n\n  simpleData.forEach(item => {\n    if (item.isPromo) {\n      // Promo card\n      const promo = figma.createFrame();\n      promo.name = \"Promo Card\";\n      promo.resize(290, 380);\n      promo.cornerRadius = 30;\n      promo.fills = [{ type: \"SOLID\", color: { r: 0.92, g: 0.95, b: 0.9 } }];\n      promo.clipsContent = true;\n      promo.layoutMode = \"VERTICAL\";\n      promo.primaryAxisAlignItems = \"SPACE_BETWEEN\";\n      promo.paddingLeft = 24;\n      promo.paddingRight = 24;\n      promo.paddingTop = 32;\n      promo.paddingBottom = 24;\n\n      const pTitle = figma.createText();\n      pTitle.characters = \"Don’t forget to eat healthy food\";\n      pTitle.fontSize = 24;\n      pTitle.fontName = { family: \"Inter\", style: \"Bold\" };\n      pTitle.fills = [{ type: \"SOLID\", color: { r: 0, g: 0, b: 0 } }];\n      promo.appendChild(pTitle);\n\n      const pImg = getInst(\"Photo_Ad_Salad\");\n      pImg.resize(240, 200);\n      promo.appendChild(pImg);\n\n      const pLink = figma.createText();\n      pLink.characters = \"www.foodielan